  - If you can’t update SSA immediately, contact the organization requesting the SSN and ask whether the spelling they have will be accepted and what documentation they need (photo ID, proof of name change, etc.).
- Security note: never send your full SSN over unsecured email or public chat. If a form only asks for the last four digits, that’s commonly accepted for identity confirmation — still combine that with the correct legal name when asked.

