- Bring or mail required original documents or certified copies: proof of identity (U.S. passport or state ID) and proof of legal name change (marriage certificate, court order, etc.).
- Check ssa.gov for local office appointments and current processing times (times vary; card replacement often arrives within a couple of weeks after approval).

