- How to check your SSA record: sign in to your SSA account at ssa.gov or call/visit your local SSA office. That will tell you the exact name variant they have on file.
- Security tip: only enter your SSN on secure, trusted sites (look for HTTPS and the organization’s official domain). Avoid emailing your SSN.

